        <line x1="4.93" y1="4.93" x2="7.05" y2="7.05"/><line x1="16.95" y1="16.95" x2="19.07" y2="19.07"/>
        <line x1="4.93" y1="19.07" x2="7.05" y2="16.95"/><line x1="16.95" y1="7.05" x2="19.07" y2="4.93"/>
      </svg>
    </button>
    <a href="mailto:hello@ethereuminstitutional.org?subject=Ethereum%20Institute%20Inquiry" class="btn-nav">Reach Out</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="mission-page">
  <section class="intro-grid">
    <div class="intro-col fu d1">
      <h1 class="page-title">Mission</h1>
      <div class="intro-text">
        <p>Institutional adoption of Ethereum is no longer theoretical. The next few years will determine the base layer of global finance, and the window is closing fast.</p>
        <p>Ethereum Institutional is an independent non-profit dedicated to ensuring Ethereum is that layer.</p>
        <p>Institutions will either fragment across competing ecosystems, fracturing liquidity and increasing systemic risk, or converge on a credibly neutral, programmable base layer. Ethereum is uniquely positioned to continue winning, as it is already today.</p>
        <p><strong>Credible neutrality:</strong> Ethereum operates without a central controlling entity, offering institutions a stable and predictable platform with minimized counterparty risk.</p>
        <p><strong>Battle-tested infrastructure:</strong> Over a decade of uptime, continuous improvement, and resilience at scale that makes Ethereum the most secure settlement layer for onchain value.</p>
        <p><strong>Ecosystem depth:</strong> The majority of meaningful onchain financial activity, across DeFi, stablecoins, and tokenized assets, already lives on Ethereum and its L2 ecosystem.</p>
        <p><strong>Developer and institutional momentum:</strong> Ethereum continues to attract the builders, standards, and capital that define the direction of the onchain economy.</p>
        <p>What Ethereum lacks is a neutral institutional front door. Other ecosystem participants today focus on protocol R&amp;D or have a vested interest in their solutions instead of overall ecosystem success.</p>
        <p>Ethereum Institutional fills that gap, working directly with financial institutions, regulators, and ecosystem participants to accelerate adoption, shape market structure, and ensure Ethereum is well represented at the highest levels of decision-making.</p>
        <p>Our goal is simple: to ensure Ethereum becomes the foundational layer for institutional finance.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
